title: '2026-11-12: a view rooted at a foreign note now follows its author''s overrides; on main, all tests pass.'
pid: 42d09fc7-377b-411f-b58c-bd1b96954811
body: |2-
  Commits fb945410 (the change), dfbcb811 (integration tests) and
  c634d897 (docs) sit on the first mind's 37453ff5, which I kept: it
  only threads an owner through the resolver. Before them, 1e7009f2 and
  dbc79a33 fix four integration tests that already failed on main,
  each left behind by a deliberate earlier change (an import rule, and
  the Emacs client's config-file variable); 'bash/all-tests.sh' failed
  without them and passes with them. That was not my territory; Tess's
  or the owners' of import and the clients, were they born.
contains:
- d96ce674-a4a2-443e-8f3c-fd4f121d0d6c
- 36eff8f6-e850-4488-9d25-fe99022f390b
- d2b1f4d5-602e-4be6-9861-05e783000aef
